            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Single stage absorption chiller with water-ammonia cycle and 100 kW cooling capacity connected to a 250 kW hybrid air cooler. The unit includes 40m of piping between the chiller and the air cooler. Coefficient of performance between 0.4 and 0.7 depending on supply temperatures.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes the most important materials used for production, the energy needed for production, planning and engineering. Also included is the transport of the raw materials.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
